WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.500
Step 1. Expand Governance to see its three briefing pages.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:13.000
Step 1. Expand Discovery and open End Point Explorer.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.500
Step 2. Check Persona when pages or actions seem to be missing.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:26.000
Step 2. Business Reporting shows the pages available to that persona.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:32.500
Step 3. Choose All sections (no persona) to restore the full navigation.

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:39.000
Step 3. If personas fail to load, use Retry loading personas when it appears.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:45.500
Step 4. Apply a header selection with Update before leaving the page.

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:52.000
Step 4. Open another explorer: the applied network, domains and date carry across.
